---
---
<section class="section" style="width: 100%; overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 12px;">
  <div
    id="creator-card-container"
    data-aos="fade-right"
    style="width: 95vw; maxWidth: 460px; display: flex; min-height: 224px; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: center; padding: 24px 24px; border-radius: 24px; background-image: url('/disenador.png'); background-size: cover; background-position: center; color: white; text-align: left;"
  >
    <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-outfit), sans-serif; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 12px 0; color: white; text-transform: lowercase;">
      creador de sellos
    </h3>
    <p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 21px; margin: 0 0 20px 0; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.92); text-align: left;">
      Diseñá tu sello escolar o profesional online en tiempo real con íconos y tipografías.
    </p>
    <button
      class="btn"
      style="margin: 0; height: 48px; padding: 0 32px; font-size: 14px; background-color: var(--primary); color: white; border: none; font-weight: 700;"
      onclick="window.location.href = '/creador'"
    >
      Diseñar mi sello
    </button>
  </div>
</section>
